# Legacy local product image mirror. No longer required for builds — as of
# 2026-08-17, data/product-image-manifest.json points at the R2 bucket
# (pub-2d92bc9fc39242bf95b565216d0b999e.r2.dev) directly, so this folder
# existing or not has no effect on deploys. Kept ignored since it's large
# and unused going forward; safe to delete.
/public/product-images/

